description = "+3 WIS, +5 STR, +4 INT. Grants Golden — 10 damage, 2 Vulnerable, 50% chance to taunt the enemy toward you for 5 tempo — and Lead — 10 damage, 2 Weaken, 50% chance to send the enemy fleeing for 5 tempo (each 45 mana, 3 tempo). An enemy struck by both arrows turns into a tree for 4 tempo: it keeps every buff and debuff, cannot act, and regenerates 3 health on each of its first 3 tempo."
